From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 11 Sep 2023 15:22:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-638] make: add falcon shores1 support

It is a multi architecure build (ARC and ARM)
ARC meant to be our main architecture, still need porting for arcboot
preboot and zephyr to have real content to be used by post scripts.
ARM is only planned to be used for CXL root port management.

Change-Id: Ib96fa5e8a57195535f5c26971305ef9b29d9adda
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

